WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.622 --> 00:00:03.639
Lesson twelve. In the Kitchen!

2
00:00:04.398 --> 00:00:11.698
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.666 --> 00:00:14.232
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.282 --> 00:00:17.588
Today we learn: In the Kitchen! Let's go!

5
00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:22.167
Plate! Say it with me. Plate!

6
00:00:26.207 --> 00:00:29.540
Spoon! Say it with me. Spoon!

7
00:00:33.538 --> 00:00:36.872
Fork! Say it with me. Fork!

8
00:00:40.837 --> 00:00:43.887
Cup! Say it with me. Cup!

9
00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:51.273
Pot! Say it with me. Pot!

10
00:00:55.215 --> 00:00:58.599
Pan! Say it with me. Pan!

11
00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:06.007
Table! Say it with me. Table!

12
00:01:10.010 --> 00:01:13.327
Chair! Say it with me. Chair!

13
00:01:17.361 --> 00:01:23.410
Listen. There is a plate. There are two cups.

14
00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:27.827
Say it with me. There is a plate. There are two cups.

15
00:01:32.673 --> 00:01:38.234
Mummy cooks rice in the pot. We put the plates, spoons, and forks on the table.

16
00:01:38.284 --> 00:01:39.633
I like this story!

17
00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:44.751
What's this?

18
00:01:44.801 --> 00:01:46.126
It's a fork!

19
00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:51.554
What's this?

20
00:01:51.604 --> 00:01:52.972
It's a pan!

21
00:01:53.948 --> 00:01:58.665
This is V. V is for van. V is for violin.

22
00:02:02.671 --> 00:02:09.839
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

23
00:02:09.889 --> 00:02:11.600
Bye-bye, friends!

